        "raw": "<p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">The Humble Store is having a sale, and [url=https://www.humblebundle.com/store/p/sentinelsofthemultiverse_storefront]Sentinels[/url] (on steam) is discounted for the next 14 odd days!</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Incredibly late answer!</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">\n[quote=\"arenson9\"]\n</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">You don&#39;t think 25% is significant? Huh. I do.</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">\n[/quote]\n</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">For a game on steam? No. Perhaps I&#39;ve just been spoiled by the discounts during the sales.</p>",
